  "solution": "Given equation: 24 - 8 + 12 ÷ 48 × 36 = 23\n\n1. + and ÷\n\n24 - __**8 ÷ 12**__ + __**48 × 36**__ = 23\n\n⇒ __**24**__ - 0.67 __**+ 1728**__ = 23\n\n⇒ __**1752 - 0.67**__ = 23\n\n⇒ 1751.34 ≠ 23\n\n2. - and +\n\n24 + 8 - __**12 ÷ 48**__ × 36 = 23\n\n⇒ 24 + 8 - __**0.25 × 36**__ = 23\n\n⇒ __**24 + 8**__ - 9 = 23\n\n⇒ __**32 - 9**__ = 23\n\n⇒ 23 = 23\n\n3. × and ÷\n\n24 - 8 + 12 ×** __48 ÷ 36__** = 23\n\n⇒ 24 - 8 + __**12 ×**____** **1.34__ = 23\n\n⇒ __**24**__ - 8 __**+ 16.08**__ = 23\n\n⇒ __**40.08 - 8**__ = 23\n\n⇒ 32.08 ≠ 23\n\n4. - and ×\n\n24 × 8 + 12 ÷ 48 - 36 = 23\n\n⇒ __**24 **____**×**____** 8**__ + __**12 ÷ 48**__ - 36 = 23\n\n⇒ __**192 + 0.25**__ - 36 = 23\n\n⇒ **192.25 - 36** = 23\n\n⇒ -16.75 ≠ 23\n\nHence, ‘**- and +**’ is the correct answer.",
